-- SDE briefings for the last COSMOS objectives (EVE Info).
-- +migrate Up
UPDATE missionObjectives SET briefingText='/h2> I congratulate you again on a job well done with those Republic pilots. Their forces are in a disarray in the system, and I feel we won''t have long to wait for a final victory over those pathetic Minmatar rats. You have proven yourself just as ruthless and capable as I like my employees to be, so it''s time to let you in on my true mission here. My Amarr lord, who shall remain nameless, is adamant that the Republic not succeed in gaining total control over Ani. But because we lack the official support of the Empire, we need to be discreet and open-minded in our dealings out here. The Angel Cartel is the strongest pirate force in the constellation. If we''re to have any chance of success here, we must strike a deal with the Angels for assistance. I know it is loathsome to be forced to deal with pirate scum, but the importance of our mission here must override any such qualms. The failure of the Republic is what matters most here. I''ve been locked in negotiations over the past few weeks with leaders from the Cartel. I feel we''ve made good progress, but the Cartel requires a token of good faith before they''ll continue the discussions. I have graciously offered them large quantities of the highly corrosive Aqua Regia acid as a gift, and they have accepted. Now, all I need is someone who can quickly ferry the acid to me so I can continue the negotiations. Do this for me and we''re one step closer to bringing the Republic to its knees here. </span' WHERE missionID=93420 AND (briefingText IS NULL OR briefingText='');
UPDATE missionObjectives SET briefingText='/h2> Okay, what I need you to do for me is find one of the famed 09-4XW gas clouds. Now of course I''m referring specifically to those gas clouds containing the materials I need for booster manufacturing. You must tell me where the cloud is and get me a sample from it. If you do this for me, I''ll give you a booster blueprint copy, plus a little extra cash if you''re fast. And you''ll learn something in the process. Sounds useful, huh? </span' WHERE missionID=93120 AND (briefingText IS NULL OR briefingText='');
